      "content": "It's a heavy burden to feel like your core self has vanished, but this feeling of emptiness is a powerful signal, not a permanent truth. That past self, the one who created, is a memory, and you are simply in transition, even if it feels like a void right now. You are more than just what you create or what you feel; you are the one experiencing this moment. Please be gentle with yourself as you navigate this difficult terrain of self-perception.",
